{"4148530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "City Transport Simulator 2026 - Bus & Tram", "steam_appid": 4148530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4428130, 4399560, 4399570, 4427800, 4399530, 4399540, 4399590, 4399470, 4399490, 4399500, 4399510, 4399520, 4399550], "detailed_description": "<h1>CTS 2026 - Editions</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/c648680b6f95fb18e8d52b01b45a8f0a.avif?t=1785398336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras_big/c648680b6f95fb18e8d52b01b45a8f0a.webp?t=1785398336 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/537501fe3fd0c9c40be924b1dbc1666a.avif?t=1785398336\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras_big/537501fe3fd0c9c40be924b1dbc1666a.webp?t=1785398336 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the next generation of urban public transport with <strong>City Transport Simulator 2026</strong>, a combined <strong>bus simulator</strong> and <strong>tram simulator</strong> set in a dynamic European-inspired city. Drive in <strong>CTS</strong> detailed buses and trams, manage your fleet, create routes and timetables, and build a public transport network that responds to your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Transport Simulator 2026 is FREE for all previous CTS owners!</strong> Transfer your DLCs at no cost and enjoy them upgraded with all the new features, including dynamic weather, free roam mode, realistic ticketing, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/2b72429e20f1d4ad8c0ec55c02f821ce.poster.avif?t=1785398336\" aria-label=\"Dynamic Weather &amp;amp; Seasons\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/2b72429e20f1d4ad8c0ec55c02f821ce.webm?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/2b72429e20f1d4ad8c0ec55c02f821ce.mp4?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City Transport Simulator 2026 introduces fully dynamic weather and seasonal changes, creating a living, evolving city environment:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal city transformation</strong> – trees, foliage, and cityscape adapt to spring, summer, autumn, and winter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunny, fog, rain, snow, or thunderstorms</strong> – dynamically changing throughout the day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Temperature changes</strong> affect vehicle heating and cooling systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All vehicles, buses and trams, feature realistic <strong>heating, cooling, and window operations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully operational wipers</strong> respond to rain and adverse weather conditions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/b40600e41e1f4ab85c09bfe9d4278a7c.poster.avif?t=1785398336\" aria-label=\"Realistic Ticketing System\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/b40600e41e1f4ab85c09bfe9d4278a7c.webm?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/b40600e41e1f4ab85c09bfe9d4278a7c.mp4?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bus now includes a fully functional ticket machine:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell tickets to passengers directly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept both <strong>cash and contactless payments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated <strong>pay table</strong> ensures correct change is given</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add an extra layer of realism to your public transport management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/9c8e23414a86f63352f57d72d3e1c1f4.poster.avif?t=1785398336\" aria-label=\"Free Roam &amp;amp; Passenger Experience\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/9c8e23414a86f63352f57d72d3e1c1f4.webm?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/9c8e23414a86f63352f57d72d3e1c1f4.mp4?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city like never before in the new free roam mode:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk as a <strong>pedestrian</strong> and board AI buses and trams as a <strong>passenger</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of vehicles at any time and switch dynamically between <strong>passenger, bus driver, and tram driver</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand over vehicles at endpoints without breaking immersion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/9c72e03b3e59d86cc221412b195f6265.poster.avif?t=1785398336\" aria-label=\"Lighting &amp;amp; Visual Enhancements\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/9c72e03b3e59d86cc221412b195f6265.webm?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/9c72e03b3e59d86cc221412b195f6265.mp4?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new dynamic lighting system brings the city to life:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic day/night cycle with atmospheric lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced interior and exterior lighting for all vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadows, reflections, and ambient effects updated for maximum realism</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/226081ea7c4ed7581323f7a5146b7b2f.poster.avif?t=1785398336\" aria-label=\"Drive Like A Pro\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/226081ea7c4ed7581323f7a5146b7b2f.webm?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/226081ea7c4ed7581323f7a5146b7b2f.mp4?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every vehicle features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precise real-world physics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic engine and ambient sounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive cockpits with fully simulated controls</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard, gamepad, joystick, and steering wheel support</strong>, with preconfigured profiles for popular wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom control mapping</strong> to play your way</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/b517655c466b98c44c7e6f65d64a9cf8.poster.avif?t=1785398336\" aria-label=\"Build &amp;amp; Manage Your Network\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/b517655c466b98c44c7e6f65d64a9cf8.webm?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/b517655c466b98c44c7e6f65d64a9cf8.mp4?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan and optimize your public transport empire:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Line Editor</strong> and <strong>Timetable Generator</strong> let you create custom tram and bus lines in just a few clicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign vehicles and let <strong>AI trams and buses follow your schedule</strong> in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor and optimize as your network grows alongside the city’s needs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Career or Sandbox – Play Your Way</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👨‍💼 <strong>Career Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small and grow your operation: transport passengers, maintain timetables, earn XP, unlock new vehicles and upgrades, and increase <strong>passenger satisfaction</strong>. Expand your network across the city and become a transport tycoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No restrictions, full freedom: explore the city, drive any vehicle, and manage lines as you like. Play with up to <strong>15 pre-made tram and bus lines</strong> or create your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name your <strong>operation, city, stations, and routes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>multiple liveries, logos, and station designs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize <strong>branding</strong> on vehicles, buildings, signs, and announcements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automated multi-language station announcements</strong> with through-line integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full control over <strong>station styles, routes, line colors, and naming</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living, Breathing City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive across <strong>50+ km of routes</strong> and <strong>80+ unique stations</strong> in a city inspired by southern Germany. Enjoy a bustling open-world city center, scenic old towns, and quiet suburbs with a fully dynamic passenger system and licensed AI vehicles, including DHL vans, and familiar stores like REWE, Tegut, MediaMarkt, and Deutsche Post.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full simulation mode with every button and system realistically modeled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy mode for relaxed gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full input support: keyboard, mouse, gamepad, joystick, steering wheel (with many preconfigured setups)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom control layouts for every device</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Long-Term Support &amp; Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City Transport Simulator 2026 is built for long-term support with ongoing updates, new vehicles, cities, and features. This is a living simulation that keeps evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to take control of the city and drive into the future?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the next generation of urban public transport with <strong>City Transport Simulator 2026</strong>, a combined <strong>bus simulator</strong> and <strong>tram simulator</strong> set in a dynamic European-inspired city. Drive in <strong>CTS</strong> detailed buses and trams, manage your fleet, create routes and timetables, and build a public transport network that responds to your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Transport Simulator 2026 is FREE for all previous CTS owners!</strong> Transfer your DLCs at no cost and enjoy them upgraded with all the new features, including dynamic weather, free roam mode, realistic ticketing, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/2b72429e20f1d4ad8c0ec55c02f821ce.poster.avif?t=1785398336\" aria-label=\"Dynamic Weather &amp;amp; Seasons\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/2b72429e20f1d4ad8c0ec55c02f821ce.webm?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/