\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/b517655c466b98c44c7e6f65d64a9cf8.poster.avif?t=1785398336\" aria-label=\"Build &amp;amp; Manage Your Network\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/b517655c466b98c44c7e6f65d64a9cf8.webm?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/extras/b517655c466b98c44c7e6f65d64a9cf8.mp4?t=1785398336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan and optimize your public transport empire:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Line Editor</strong> and <strong>Timetable Generator</strong> let you create custom tram and bus lines in just a few clicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign vehicles and let <strong>AI trams and buses follow your schedule</strong> in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor and optimize as your network grows alongside the city’s needs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Career or Sandbox – Play Your Way</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👨‍💼 <strong>Career Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small and grow your operation: transport passengers, maintain timetables, earn XP, unlock new vehicles and upgrades, and increase <strong>passenger satisfaction</strong>. Expand your network across the city and become a transport tycoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No restrictions, full freedom: explore the city, drive any vehicle, and manage lines as you like. Play with up to <strong>15 pre-made tram and bus lines</strong> or create your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name your <strong>operation, city, stations, and routes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>multiple liveries, logos, and station designs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize <strong>branding</strong> on vehicles, buildings, signs, and announcements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automated multi-language station announcements</strong> with through-line integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full control over <strong>station styles, routes, line colors, and naming</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living, Breathing City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive across <strong>50+ km of routes</strong> and <strong>80+ unique stations</strong> in a city inspired by southern Germany. Enjoy a bustling open-world city center, scenic old towns, and quiet suburbs with a fully dynamic passenger system and licensed AI vehicles, including DHL vans, and familiar stores like REWE, Tegut, MediaMarkt, and Deutsche Post.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full simulation mode with every button and system realistically modeled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy mode for relaxed gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full input support: keyboard, mouse, gamepad, joystick, steering wheel (with many preconfigured setups)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom control layouts for every device</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Long-Term Support &amp; Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City Transport Simulator 2026 is built for long-term support with ongoing updates, new vehicles, cities, and features. This is a living simulation that keeps evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to take control of the city and drive into the future?</strong></p>", "short_description": "City Transport Simulator 2026 combines a detailed bus simulator and tram simulator in one game. Drive realistic buses and trams, create routes and timetables, manage your fleet, and build your own public transport network in a dynamic European-inspired city.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/7c125dae2a3406eb8cb2c07d1ae29e4596318a31/header.jpg?t=1785398336", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/337c753a824ef84ccfabadfb820fd47a17971aac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785398336", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148530/337c753a824ef84ccfabadfb820fd47a17971aac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785398336", "website": "https://citytransportsimulator.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10 or Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> from 2.9 GHz AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or Intel Core i5-10400F or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 or AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT, each with 8 GB VRAM or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or dedicated compatible soundcard<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires mouse and keyboa